menu "ENKU bring-up"

config ENKU_BRINGUP_SMOKE_TESTS
    bool "Run hardware smoke tests before application runtime"
    default y
    help
        Run storage, display and power bring-up checks on boot.
        Keep enabled while validating the first physical board.
        Disable for normal reader operation after hardware bring-up is stable.

config ENKU_RAW_INPUT_DIAGNOSTIC
    bool "Run raw input diagnostic when Reader font is missing"
    default y
    depends on ENKU_BRINGUP_SMOKE_TESTS
    help
        If Noto Sans is not provisioned, keep GPIO button verification
        available instead of immediately idling.

endmenu
